de & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard \\u2014 reviewed\\n\\n- Mikuni/Keihin Carburetor Tuning Manual & Bosch Automotive Gasoline Injection Handbook \\u2014 reviewed\\n\\n- Honda V-Matic Transmission System Service Manual / Yamaha CVT Technician Guide \\u2014 reviewed\\n\\n_Technical procedure text is kept close to its source wording to avoid changing measurements or safety meaning._\\n\\n**Limitations:**\\n\\n- This is offline guidance from stored records, not a confirmed diagnosis.\\n\\n- The stored record may not cover your exact model, year, or variant. Verify part numbers and specifications against the manufacturer information for your vehicle.\\n\\n**Next action:** What model year is it? If you are not sure, say \\u201cnot sure\\u201d and I will avoid year-specific specifications.\\n\\n[chips: Not sure]\", \"language\": \"english\", \"intent\": \"diagnostic_offline\", \"diagnostic_stage\": \"tests\", \"vehicle_profile\": {\"vehicle_type\": \"motorcycle\", \"make\": \"Honda\", \"model\": \"Click\", \"year\": \"\", \"variant\": \"\", \"engine_displacement\": \"125cc\", \"fuel_system\": \"fi\"}, \"symptoms\": [\"give me a step by step on how to fix the minor in click v4\"], \"missing_questions\": [{\"question\": \"What model year is it? If you are not sure, say \\u201cnot sure\\u201d and I will avoid year-specific specifications.\", \"why\": \"Model year changes parts and procedures on many vehicles.\", \"options\": [\"Not sure\"]}], \"safety\": {\"severity\": \"none\", \"summary\": \"\", \"warnings\": [], \"stop_use\": false}, \"possible_causes\": [{\"cause\": \"Discharged or dead 12V motorcycle battery\", \"confidence\": \"high\", \"evidence\": \"Measure DC resting voltage across battery terminals using a digital multimeter.\", \"uncertainty\": \"If voltage reads below 12.0V DC resting or plunges below 9.5V during cranking, battery cells are depleted or damaged.\"}, {\"cause\": \"Blown main fuse or disconnected engine ground\", \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"e