(454,80,1,'assistant','> [!WARNING]\n> Brake system caution: Brake work involves hydraulic pressure and safety-critical parts. Use the correct fluid and verify the repair at low speed in a safe area before normal riding.\n\nCheck brake pads (replace around 2 mm), fluid level and colour, and a firm lever. Bleed every 1–2 years or if the lever feels spongy. Do not ride with a leak or a sinking lever.\n\n[chips: Brake pad check | Brake fluid | Bleeding brakes | Maintenance schedule]','english','{\"reply_text\": \"> [!WARNING]\\n> Brake system caution: Brake work involves hydraulic pressure and safety-critical parts. Use the correct fluid and verify the repair at low speed in a safe area before normal riding.\\n\\nCheck brake pads (replace around 2 mm), fluid level and colour, and a firm lever. Bleed every 1\\u20132 years or if the lever feels spongy. Do not ride with a leak or a sinking lever.\\n\\n[chips: Brake pad check | Brake fluid | Bleeding brakes | Maintenance schedule]\", \"language\": \"english\", \"intent\": \"general_motorcycle_question\", \"diagnostic_stage\": \"general\", \"vehicle_profile\": {\"vehicle_type\": \"\", \"make\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"year\": \"\", \"variant\": \"\", \"engine_displacement\": \"\", \"fuel_system\": \"\"}, \"symptoms\": [], \"missing_questions\": [], \"safety\": {\"severity\": \"warning\", \"summary\": \"Brake system caution: Brake work involves hydraulic pressure and safety-critical parts. Use the correct fluid and verify the repair at low speed in a safe area before normal riding.\", \"warnings\": [\"Brake system caution: Brake work involves hydraulic pressure and safety-critical parts. Use the correct fluid and verify the repair at low speed in a safe area before normal riding.\"], \"stop_use\": false}, \"possible_causes\": [], \"findings\": \"\", \"visible_evidence\": [], \"diagnostic_tests\": [], \"required_tools\": [], \"required_parts\": [], \"repair_steps\": [], \"verification\": [], \"sources\": [], \"next_action\": \"Answer the question or ask a relevant follow-up\", \"related_components\": [], \"limitations\": [\"This is guidance from an automated assistant, not a confirmed diagnosis or a substitute for an in-person inspection.\"], \"offline\": true, \"offline_reason\": \"\", \"chips\": [\"Brake pad check\", \"Brake fluid\", \"Bleeding brakes\", \"Maintenance schedule\"]}','offline','warning','2026-11-10 00:48:52.877042'),
