(476,85,1,'assistant','I understand you are experiencing battery drain or charging issues on your motorcycle. To assist you accurately, I need to identify the specific motorcycle you are working on. Please note that when testing the charging system, you must remove all metal jewelry and wristwatches to prevent accidental short-circuits. Could you please provide the make, model, and year of your motorcycle? Additionally, have you noticed any warning lights on the dashboard, such as a battery symbol?\n\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]','english','{\"reply_text\": \"I understand you are experiencing battery drain or charging issues on your motorcycle. To assist you accurately, I need to identify the specific motorcycle you are working on. Please note that when testing the charging system, you must remove all metal jewelry and wristwatches to prevent accidental short-circuits. Could you please provide the make, model, and year of your motorcycle? Additionally, have you noticed any warning lights on the dashboard, such as a battery symbol?\\n\\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]\", \"language\": \"english\", \"intent\": \"diagnose battery charging issue\", \"diagnostic_stage\": \"identification\", \"vehicle_profile\": {\"vehicle_type\": \"motorcycle\", \"make\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"year\": \"\", \"variant\": \"\", \"engine_displacement\": \"\", \"fuel_system\": \"\"}, \"symptoms\": [\"battery draining\", \"not charging while running\"], \"missing_questions\": [{\"question\": \"What is the make, model, and year of your motorcycle?\", \"why\": \"To provide accurate diagnostic steps and verify compatibility with local records.\", \"options\": []}, {\"question\": \"Are there any warning lights illuminated on your dashboard?\", \"why\": \"To determine if the motorcycle\'s ECU or charging system has detected a fault.\", \"options\": []}, {\"question\": \"What is your motorcycle make, model, and year? (e.g. Click 1