ional (BCI) Technical Guidelines & Motorcycle Service Manual Section 16 (Electrical)\", \"reference\": \"Battery Council International (BCI) Technical Guidelines & Motorcycle Service Manual Section 16 (Electrical)\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}, {\"title\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reference\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}], \"next_action\": \"Identify vehicle and confirm basic fuel/spark status.\", \"related_components\": [\"engine\"], \"limitations\": [\"This is guidance from an automated assistant, not a confirmed diagnosis or a substitute for an in-person inspection.\"], \"offline\": false, \"offline_reason\": \"\", \"chips\": [\"Explain in simpler terms\", \"What should I check first?\"]}','ai','none','2026-11-13 14:10:35.008805'),
