Technical Guidelines & Motorcycle Service Manual Section 16 (Electrical)\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}, {\"title\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reference\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}], \"next_action\": \"Identify vehicle details\", \"related_components\": [\"engine\"], \"limitations\": [\"This is guidance from an automated assistant, not a confirmed diagnosis or a substitute for an in-person inspection.\"], \"offline\": false, \"offline_reason\": \"\", \"chips\": [\"Honda Click 125i\", \"Yamaha NMAX 155\", \"Not sure\", \"Explain in simpler terms\", \"What should I check first?\"]}','ai','none','2026-11-15 12:48:02.234998'),
(483,87,1,'user','Yamaha NMAX 155','english',NULL,'ai','none','2026-11-15 12:48:28.979831'),
(484,87,1,'assistant','Since the engine cranks but fails to start, we need to check for fuel delivery and spark. Do you hear the fuel pump prime for a few seconds when you turn the ignition to ON, and have you checked if the spark plug is wet with fuel after attempting to start?\n\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]','english','{\"reply_text\": \"Since the engine cranks but fails to start, we need to check for fuel delivery and spark. Do you hear the fuel pump prime for a few seconds when you turn the ignition to ON, and have you checked if the spark plug is wet with fuel after attempting to start?\\n\\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]\", \"language\": \"english\", \"intent\": \"diagnose_no_start\", \"diagnostic_stage\": \"tests\", \"vehicle_profile\": {\"vehicle_type\": \"motorcycle\", \"make\": \"Yamaha\", \"model\": \"Nmax 155\", \"year\": \"\", \"variant\": \"\", \"engine_displacement\": \"\", \"fuel_system\": \"\"}, \"symptoms\": [\"engine cranks normally but won\'t start\"], \"missing_questions\": [{\"question\": \"Do you hear the fuel pump prime when the ignition is turned to ON?\", \"why\": \"To determine if the fuel system is receiving power and initializing.\", \"options\": []}, {\"question\": \"Is the spark plug wet with fuel after several failed start attempts?\", \"why\": \"To check if fuel is reaching the combustion chamber.\", \"options\": []}, {\"question\": \"What model year is it? If you are not sure, say \\u201cnot sure\\u201d and I will avoid year-specific specifications.\", \"why\": \"Model year changes parts and procedures on many vehicles.\", \"options\": [\"Not sure\"]}], \"safety\": {\"severity\": \"none\", \"summary\": \"\", \"warnings\": [], \"stop_use\": false}, \"possible_causes\": [], \"findings\": \"\", \"visible_evidence\": [], \"diagnostic_tests\": [], \"required_tools\": [], \"required_parts\": [], \"repair_steps\": [], \"verification\": [], \"sources\": [{\"title\": \"Battery Council International (BCI) Technical Guidelines & Motorcycle Service Manual Section 16 (Electrical)\", \"reference\": \"Battery Council International (BCI) Technical Guidelines & Motorcycle Service Manual Section 16 (Electrical)\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}, {\"title\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reference\": \"OEM Electrical Troubleshooting Guide & SAE J1284 Blade Type Fuses standard\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"\"}], \"next_action\": \"Verify fuel pump operation and spark plug condition.\", \"related_components\": [], \"limitations\": [\"This is guidance from an automated assistant, not a confirmed diagnosis or a substitute for an in-person inspection.\"], \"offline\": false, \"offline_reason\": \"\", \"chips\": [\"Explain in simpler terms\", \"What should I check first?\"]}','ai','none','2026-11-15 12:48:28.981161'),
(485,87,1,'user','Engine won\'t start: my engine won\'t start but the dash lights turn on','english',NULL,'ai','none','2026-11-15 12:49:10.821608'),
(486,87,1,'assistant','Since the dash lights illuminate, the battery has power, but we must confirm if the fuel pump and spark plug are functioning. Please confirm if you hear a faint humming sound from the fuel pump for a few seconds when you turn the ignition to ON, and let me know if the spark plug is wet with fuel after your failed start attempts.\n\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]','english','{\"reply_text\": \"Since the dash lights illuminate, the battery has power, but we must confirm if the fuel pump and spark plug are functioning. Please confirm if you hear a faint humming sound from the fuel pump for a few seconds when you turn the ignition to ON, and let me know if the spark plug is wet with fuel after your failed start attempts.\\n\\n[chips: Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?]\", \"language\": \"english\", \"intent\": \"diagnose no-start condition\", \"diagnostic_stage\": \"tests\", \"vehicle_profile\": {\"vehicle_type\": \"motorcycle\", \"make\": \"Yamaha\", \"model\": \"Nmax 155\", \"year\": \"\", \"variant\": \"\", \"engine_displacement\": \"\", \"fuel_system\": \"fuel injection\"}, \"symptoms\": [\"engine cranks normally but won\'t start\"], \"missing_questions\": [{\"question\": \"Do you hear the fuel pump prime when the ignition is turned to ON?\", \"why\": \"To verify if the fuel system is pressurized and the ECU is powering the pump.\", \"options\": []}, {\"question\": \"Is the spark plug wet with fuel after several failed start attempts?\", \"why\": \"To determine if fuel is reaching the combustion chamber or if the engine is flooded.\", \"options\": []}], \"safety\": {\"severity\": \"none\", \"summary\": \"\", \"warnings\": [], \"stop_use\": false}, \"possible_causes\": [], \"findings\": \"\", \"visible_evidence\": [], \"diagnostic_tests\": [], \"required_tools\": [], \"required_parts\": [], \"repair_steps\": [], \"verification\": [], \"sources\": [{\"title\": \"Motorcycle Lighting & Headlamp Service Manual\", \"reference\": \"OEM Motorcycle Electrical & Lighting Systems Manual Section 18\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"2023-02-18\"}, {\"title\": \"SAE J1284 Blade Fuse & Circuit Standards\", \"reference\": \"SAE J1284 Blade Type Automotive Fuses Standard\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"2022-04-12\"}, {\"title\": \"Handlebar Controls & Grounding Service Manual\", \"reference\": \"OEM Handlebar Switch & Controls Technical Service Manual\", \"reviewed\": true, \"date\": \"2023-01-20\"}], \"next_action\": \"Verify fuel pump priming sound and spark plug condition.\", \"related_components\": [\"engine\"], \"limitations\": [\"This is guidance from an automated assistant, not a confirmed diagnosis or a substitute for an in-person inspection.\"], \"offline\": false, \"offline_reason\": \"\", \"chips\": [\"Explain in simpler terms\", \"What should I check first?\"]}','ai','none','2026-11-15 12:49:10.823247'),
