(82,1,'Bajaj CT 100 — bajaj ct 100','english','motorcycle','Bajaj','CT 100','','','100CC','carburetor','bajaj ct 100; electrical system concerns; engine cut-out; headlight issues; battery charging issues','[\"What model year is it? If you are not sure, say \\u201cnot sure\\u201d and I will avoid year-specific specifications.\", \"Are you experiencing a specific symptom, such as the engine cutting out while riding, or is the battery failing to charge?\", \"What model year is your Bajaj CT 100?\", \"Does the engine cut out only when you use the headlight, or does it happen randomly?\", \"When you turn the key, do the dashboard lights turn on, or is the bike completely \'dead\'?\"]','[]','','closed','Vehicle: Bajaj CT 100. Reported symptoms: bajaj ct 100; electrical system concerns; engine cut-out; headlight issues; battery charging issues. Questions asked: What model year is it? If you are not sure, say “not sure” and I will avoid year-specific specifications.; Are you experiencing a specific symptom, such as the engine cutting out while riding, or is the battery failing to charge?; What model year is your Bajaj CT 100?; Does the engine cut out only when you use the headlight, or does it happen randomly?; When you turn the key, do the dashboard lights turn on, or is the bike completely \'dead\'?. Recent: user: jarvis | assistant: Sir, this is MotorAssistant, designed specifically to help you diagnose, maintain, and fix problems on your motorcycle, scooter, or underbone. Is this inquiry regarding a motorcycle? If you have a motorcycle problem or question, please let me know your motorcycle\'s make, model, and what issue you ne | user: bajaj ct 100 | assistant: Understood. I have noted your Bajaj CT 100. Since you have not mentioned a specific issue, please describe the symptom you are experiencing with your motorcycle so I can assist you with the correct diagnostic steps. [chips: Not sure | Explain in simpler terms | What should I check first?] | user: electrical and ignition what controls the engine cut outs which headlight and battery charging | assistant: To help you diagnose the electrical system on your Bajaj CT 100, we need to look at the components responsible for engine cut-off, headlight operation, and battery charging. These systems are interconnected through the ignition switch, the charging circuit (stator/rectifier), and the main wiring har',0,'2026-11-13 12:08:52.549675','2026-11-13 12:23:58.024858'),
(83,1,'electrical and ignition what controls the engine cut outs which headlight and battery charging','english','','','','','','','','electrical and ignition what controls the engine cut outs which headlight and battery charging','[\"What is your motorcycle make, model, and year? (e.g. Click 125i, NMAX 155, Barako 175).\"]','[]','','closed','Reported symptoms: electrical and ignition what controls the engine cut outs which headlight and battery charging. Questions asked: What is your motorcycle make, model, and year? (e.g. Click 125i, NMAX 155, Barako 175)..',0,'2026-11-13 12:26:00.292924','2026-11-13 12:26:02.764820'),
(84,1,'Engine cranks normally; Engine will not start or fire up','english','motorcycle','','','','','','','Engine cranks normally; Engine will not start or fire up','[\"What is the make, model, and year of your motorcycle?\", \"Did this issue start suddenly, or was the motorcycle sitting for a long period before this happened?\", \"What is your motorcycle make, model, and year? (e.g. Click 125i, NMAX 155, Barako 175).\"]','[]','','closed','Reported symptoms: Engine cranks normally; Engine will not start or fire up. Questions asked: What is the make, model, and year of your motorcycle?; Did this issue start suddenly, or was the motorcycle sitting for a long period before this happened?; What is your motorcycle make, model, and year? (e.g. Click 125i, NMAX 155, Barako 175).. Recent: user: My motorcycle engine cranks normally but won\'t start or fire up. | assistant: I understand your motorcycle engine cranks normally but fails to start. To help you diagnose this, I need to identify your specific motorcycle. Please provide the make, model, and year of your motorcycle. Additionally, have you noticed any unusual smells, such as raw fuel, or did this issue happen s',0,'2026-11-13 13:30:12.569783','2026-11-13 13:30:43.207496'),
